@startuml
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
state "Pending Sync" as Pending
Pending : shown to the user immediately
state "Syncing" as Syncing
state "Synced" as Synced
[*] --> Pending : entry created or edited
Pending --> Syncing : connection available
Syncing --> Synced : server confirms\n(same id: no duplicate)
Syncing --> Pending : failure / retry later
Synced --> Pending : entry edited
Synced --> [*] : entry deleted [online]
Pending --> [*] : entry deleted\n/ deletion queued
@enduml
